<section class="page-hero about-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <p class="sec-lbl"><span class="li on" data-lang="id">Siapa kami</span><span class="li" data-lang="en">Who we are</span><span class="li" data-lang="ar">من نحن</span><span class="li" data-lang="zh">我们是谁</span></p>
    <h1 class="page-hero-title"><span class="li on" data-lang="id">Tentang HUD</span><span class="li" data-lang="en">About HUD</span><span class="li" data-lang="ar">عن HUD</span><span class="li" data-lang="zh">关于 HUD</span></h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="filosofi">
  <div class="about-wrap">
    <div class="about-logo-wrap">
      <svg width="130" height="160" viewBox="0 0 130 160" aria-label="HUD Symbol">
        <line x1="8" y1="134" x2="122" y2="134" stroke="#2D6A4F" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <circle cx="65" cy="56" r="36" fill="none" stroke="#2D6A4F" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <circle cx="65" cy="56" r="36" fill="none" stroke="#52B788" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.3"/>
        <circle cx="65" cy="56" r="9" fill="#2D6A4F" opacity="0.9"/>
        <line x1="65" y1="92" x2="65" y2="134" stroke="#2D6A4F" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text">
      <h2 class="sec-ttl" style="margin-bottom:16px;"><span class="li on" data-lang="id">Happiness Until Destination</span><span class="li" data-lang="en">Happiness Until Destination</span><span class="li" data-lang="ar">السعادة حتى الوصول</span><span class="li" data-lang="zh">快乐直至终点</span></h2>
      <div style="width:40px;height:0.5px;background:var(--forest);margin-bottom:24px;"></div>
      <p class="about-sub">
        <span class="li on" data-lang="id">HUD adalah production house yang lahir dari keyakinan sederhana: bahwa perjalanan menuju tujuan adalah tujuan itu sendiri. Kami tidak sedang bekerja — kami sedang bermain, bersenang-senang, dan menciptakan sesuatu yang bermakna dalam setiap langkah perjalanan ini.</span>
        <span class="li" data-lang="en">HUD is a production house born from a simple belief: that the journey toward the destination is the destination itself. We are not working — we are playing, enjoying, and creating something meaningful with every step of this journey.</span>
        <span class="li" data-lang="ar">HUD هو بيت إنتاج وُلد من إيمان بسيط: أن الرحلة نحو الوجهة هي الوجهة ذاتها. نحن لا نعمل — بل نلعب ونستمتع ونبدع في كل خطوة من هذه الرحلة.</span>
        <span class="li" data-lang="zh">HUD是一家制片公司，诞生于一个简单的信念：通往目的地的旅程本身就是目的地。我们不是在工作——我们在玩耍、享受，并在旅途的每一步中创造有意义的事物。</span>
      </p>
      <p class="about-sub" style="margin-top:16px;">
        <span class="li on" data-lang="id">Berbasis di Pontianak, Kalimantan Barat — kami percaya bahwa cerita terbaik tidak selalu lahir dari kota besar. Kalimantan menyimpan cerita yang belum pernah ada di layar. Dan kami ada untuk menceritakannya.</span>
        <span class="li" data-lang="en">Based in Pontianak, West Kalimantan — we believe the best stories don't always come from big cities. Kalimantan holds stories never seen on screen. And we're here to tell them.</span>
        <span class="li" data-lang="ar">مقرنا في بونتياناك، كاليمانتان الغربية — نؤمن بأن أفضل القصص لا تأتي دائماً من المدن الكبرى.</span>
        <span class="li" data-lang="zh">总部位于西加里曼丹坤甸——我们相信最好的故事并不总是来自大城市。加里曼丹蕴藏着从未在银幕上出现过的故事，而我们在这里讲述它们。</span>
      </p>
      <div class="phi-grid">
        {{#each (array (object letter='H' word='Happiness' descId='Bahagia dalam setiap proses produksi, tanpa kecuali.' descEn='Joy in every single step of the production process.' descAr='السعادة في كل مرحلة من مراحل الإنتاج.' descZh='在制作过程的每一步中感受快乐。') (object letter='U' word='Until' descId='Perjalanan yang tidak pernah berhenti. Selalu ada cerita berikutnya.' descEn="A journey that never stops. There's always the next story." descAr='رحلة لا تتوقف. هناك دائماً قصة تالية.' descZh='永不停歇的旅程。总有下一个故事。') (object letter='D' word='Destination' descId='Wealthy di dunia, surga di akhirat. Dua tujuan yang saling menguatkan.' descEn='Wealth in this world, paradise in the next. Two goals that strengthen each other.' descAr='الثروة في الدنيا والجنة في الآخرة. هدفان يقوّي كل منهما الآخر.' descZh='今生富足，来世天堂。两个相互促进的目标。'))}}
        <div class="phi-card">
          <div class="phi-letter">H</div>
          <div class="phi-word">Happiness</div>
          <p class="phi-desc"><span class="li on" data-lang="id">Bahagia dalam setiap proses produksi, tanpa kecuali.</span><span class="li" data-lang="en">Joy in every single step of the production process.</span><span class="li" data-lang="ar">السعادة في كل مرحلة من مراحل الإنتاج.</span><span class="li" data-lang="zh">在制作过程的每一步中感受快乐。</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="phi-card">
          <div class="phi-letter">U</div>
          <div class="phi-word">Until</div>
          <p class="phi-desc"><span class="li on" data-lang="id">Perjalanan yang tidak pernah berhenti. Selalu ada cerita berikutnya.</span><span class="li" data-lang="en">A journey that never stops. There's always the next story.</span><span class="li" data-lang="ar">رحلة لا تتوقف. هناك دائماً قصة تالية.</span><span class="li" data-lang="zh">永不停歇的旅程。总有下一个故事。</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="phi-card">
          <div class="phi-letter">D</div>
          <div class="phi-word">Destination</div>
          <p class="phi-desc"><span class="li on" data-lang="id">Wealthy di dunia, surga di akhirat. Dua tujuan yang saling menguatkan.</span><span class="li" data-lang="en">Wealth in this world, paradise in the next. Two goals that strengthen each other.</span><span class="li" data-lang="ar">الثروة في الدنيا والجنة في الآخرة.</span><span class="li" data-lang="zh">今生富足，来世天堂。两个相互促进的目标。</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROSES -->
<section class="sec" style="background:rgba(17,26,19,0.5);" id="proses">
  <div class="sec-hdr">
    <div>
      <p class="sec-lbl"><span class="li on" data-lang="id">Cara kami bekerja</span><span class="li" data-lang="en">How we work</span><span class="li" data-lang="ar">كيف نعمل</span><span class="li" data-lang="zh">我们的工作方式</span></p>
      <h2 class="sec-ttl"><span class="li on" data-lang="id">Proses HUD</span><span class="li" data-lang="en">HUD Process</span><span class="li" data-lang="ar">عملية HUD</span><span class="li" data-lang="zh">HUD流程</span></h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="process-steps">
    {{#each processSteps}}
    <div class="step{{#eq @index 0}} active-step{{/eq}}">
      <div class="step-num">{{num}}</div>
      <h3 class="step-name"><span class="li on" data-lang="id">{{nameId}}</span><span class="li" data-lang="en">{{nameEn}}</span><span class="li" data-lang="ar">{{nameAr}}</span><span class="li" data-lang="zh">{{nameZh}}</span></h3>
      <p class="step-desc"><span class="li on" data-lang="id">{{descId}}</span><span class="li" data-lang="en">{{descEn}}</span><span class="li" data-lang="ar">{{descAr}}</span><span class="li" data-lang="zh">{{descZh}}</span></p>
    </div>
    {{/each}}
  </div>
</section>

